---
export const prerender = true;
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>
  TotalSportek Privacy Policy | Visitor Data, Cookies & Privacy Information
</title>

<meta
  name="description"
  content="Discover how TotalSportek approaches privacy, website information, cookies, security, and online browsing. This policy explains general data practices and the measures intended to support a clear and privacy-conscious experience."
/>

<meta
  name="keywords"
  content="TotalSportek Privacy, TotalSportek privacy policy, TotalSportek data policy, TotalSportek cookies, TotalSportek website privacy, visitor privacy, browsing data, cookie information, online security, website protection, privacy guidelines, TotalSportek data information"
/>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />

    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Roboto+Condensed:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>

  <body class="bg-[#09090f]">
    <header class="bg-[#131320] border-b border-white/5">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="h-16 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <a
            href="/"
            class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f9fafb] hover:text-purple-400 transition whitespace-nowrap"
          >
            TotalSportek
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 space-y-8">

 <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-6 text-[#f9fafb]">
  TotalSportek Privacy Policy | Website Data, Cookies & Visitor Privacy
</h1>

<p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm">
  Last Updated: August 20, 2026
</p>

<div class="space-y-6 text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
      Privacy at TotalSportek
    </h2>

    <p>
      TotalSportek aims to provide visitors with a straightforward and
      privacy-conscious browsing experience. This policy explains the types
      of information that may be associated with website usage, how such
      information may be handled, the role of cookies and similar tools,
      and the general practices used to support the website.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
      Data That May Be Collected
    </h2>

    <p>
      Some technical information can be generated when visitors access
      TotalSportek. Depending on the services being used, this may include
      browser type, device information, operating system, referring page,
      approximate geographic information, visited pages, interaction
      patterns, and technical identifiers. Information may also be supplied
      voluntarily when a visitor contacts TotalSportek.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
      Why Website Information Is Used
    </h2>

    <p>
      Available website information may be used to understand visitor
      activity, improve page performance, troubleshoot errors, maintain
      features, enhance navigation, monitor functionality, and make the
      TotalSportek experience work more effectively across different
      browsers and devices.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
      Cookies and Similar Tools
    </h2>

    <p>
      TotalSportek and certain services operating alongside the website may
      use cookies, local browser storage, pixels, or comparable technologies.
      These tools can assist with website functionality, preferences,
      performance measurement, usage analysis, and other site-related
      purposes. Visitors can usually manage or remove cookies through the
      settings available in their web browser.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
      External Service Providers
    </h2>

    <p>
      TotalSportek may work with third-party services that support areas such
      as hosting, analytics, advertising, security, performance, or other
      website functions. Independent providers may process certain technical
      information under their own policies and conditions. Visitors should
      review the privacy information of those services when using or
      interacting with third-party features.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
      Website Security
    </h2>

    <p>
      Reasonable technical measures may be used to help protect website
      systems and information from unauthorized activity, misuse, or
      disruption. However, online systems and internet communications cannot
      be guaranteed to remain completely secure under every circumstance.
      TotalSportek therefore cannot promise absolute protection from every
      possible security incident.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
      Your Privacy Options
    </h2>

    <p>
      Depending on the visitor's location and applicable privacy laws,
      certain rights may be available concerning personal information.
      These may include requesting access, correction, deletion, restriction,
      or other forms of control where legally applicable. Requests may
      require reasonable verification before they can be processed.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
      Children and the Website
    </h2>

    <p>
      TotalSportek is intended as a general sports website and does not
      knowingly seek personal information from children where such collection
      is restricted by applicable law. If information is brought to our
      attention that appears to have been submitted in circumstances where
      collection is not permitted, appropriate steps may be considered.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
      Updates to Our Privacy Policy
    </h2>

    <p>
      This policy may be revised when TotalSportek changes its website
      features, technologies, services, information practices, or when
      applicable legal requirements are updated. Changes may be posted on
      this page, with the latest revision date shown above so visitors can
      identify the current version.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
      Contact TotalSportek About Privacy
    </h2>

    <p>
      Questions about this policy, privacy concerns, or requests relating
      to website information can be submitted through the available
      TotalSportek contact channel. Providing enough detail about your
      request can help us understand and respond to the matter appropriately.
    </p>

    <a
      href="mailto:support@totalsportek.example"
      class="inline-block mt-2 text-[#c084fc] hover:text-[#d8b4fe] transition"
    >
        support@buffStreamstv.cfd
    </a>

  </div>



      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>